<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gucci raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gucci raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley upgraded Gucci Group NV to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 66-1/4 Wednesday.</p>
